cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or computational framework, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "DLBCL Dynamic Reserve Model"

type: software

authors:
  - name: "Prihantini"

repository-code: "https://github.com/TitinPrihantini4/dlbcl-dynamic-reserve-model"

url: "https://github.com/TitinPrihantini4/dlbcl-dynamic-reserve-model"

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  A reproducible theoretical regime-switching computational framework
  describing the interaction between treatment intensity, hematologic
  reserve, functional recovery, disease burden, and comorbidity during
  first-line therapy for diffuse large B-cell lymphoma (DLBCL).
  The repository provides the computational implementation and
  reproducibility materials for scenario analysis, sensitivity analysis,
  uncertainty assessment, and numerical robustness evaluation.

keywords:
  - diffuse large B-cell lymphoma
  - DLBCL
  - mathematical modeling
  - computational oncology
  - regime-switching model
  - relative dose intensity
  - treatment reserve
  - sensitivity analysis
  - uncertainty quantification
  - reproducible research
